### AI Fruit Ripeness Recognizer — request collection
### Works in VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client. Run top to bottom.

@api = http://localhost:3000/api
@ml  = http://localhost:5001

### health of every tier
GET {{api}}/health

### the ML service on its own (mode tells you which weights are loaded)
GET {{ml}}/health

### the taxonomy the UI renders
GET {{api}}/detect/classes

### register
# @name register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nawaf", "email": "nawaf@example.com", "password": "Password123", "language": "en" }

### login
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nawaf@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### detect (replace the path with a real image)
# @name detect
POST {{api}}/detect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=X

--X
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="banana.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/banana.jpg
--X
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lang"

en
--X--

@scan = {{detect.response.body.scanId}}

### ask about that scan — grounded in its detections
POST {{api}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How should I store this?", "scanId": {{scan}}, "lang": "en" }

### the same question in Arabic
POST {{api}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "كيف أحفظها؟", "scanId": {{scan}}, "lang": "ar" }

### correct a wrong stage — this becomes training data
POST {{api}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "detectionId": 1, "correctedStage": "ripe", "message": "it was still fine" }

### history and basket statistics
GET {{api}}/detect/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/detect/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### admin (log in as the seeded admin first)
GET {{api}}/admin/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/admin/retraining-set
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
